      "SEO index -set": 1,
      "SEO follow -set": 0,
      "SEO description -text": "The Central Limit Theorem is a theorem of huge importance in statistics. It says that if you sample an experiment enough times, then the average of those samples will be a normal random variable even if the random variable of the experiment itself was not normal.",
